    en: \{\par
        nav_why:"Why it matters",nav_team:"Our Team",nav_trainings:"Trainings",nav_packages:"Packages",nav_contact:"First Call",\par
        hero_title_1:"Because understanding doesn't need a language \endash ",hero_title_2:"but it needs a voice.",\par
        hero_sub_1:"Not just any voice \endash  but a voice ",hero_sub_2:"that listens. That understands. That stays.",\par
        hero_text:"Professional telephone senior care in your native language. Trained staff from the Balkans. Premium Experience Day. Individual trainings. For the diaspora in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland.",\par
        hero_btn1:"Start Trial Month",hero_btn2:"Meet Our Team",\par
        why_label:"Why this matters",why_title_1:"Your parents deserve more",why_title_2:"than a \'84I'm fine\ldblquote  on the phone.",\par
        why_text:"Loneliness is not a marginal phenomenon. It is a silent crisis affecting millions \endash  and the older generation of the Balkan diaspora is hit twice as hard.",\par
        stat1:"of those over 75 in Germany often feel lonely",stat2:"seniors of the Balkan diaspora in DACH live alone",stat3:"higher risk of depression with social isolation",stat4:"care services spend on companionship \endash  they only treat the body",\par
        why_quote:"\'84Loneliness is not an illness you can see. But it is one you can feel \endash  every day. It disappears when someone is there.\ldblquote ",\par
        team_label:"Our Team",team_title_1:"The person behind the call.",team_title_2:"The heart of our service.",\par
        team_h3_1:"We are not a call center. ",team_h3_2:"We are people.",\par
        team_p1:"Every caregiver is carefully selected, trained and supported. We don't look for the first available \endash  we look for the right one.",\par
        team_p2:"Our caregivers come from the former Yugoslavia. They know the culture, the language, the stories.",\par
        tv1_t:"We adapt.",tv1_d:"No case is like another. We find solutions.",\par
        tv2_t:"We don't give up.",tv2_d:"When a senior shuts down, we find a way in.",\par
        tv3_t:"We are a team.",tv3_d:"Caregiver, coordinator and family work hand in hand.",\par
        tv4_t:"We learn every day.",tv4_d:"From every conversation, every case, every feedback.",\par
        team_quote:"I had a senior who didn't say a word for three weeks. I didn't give up. Suddenly he started talking. Two hours. Since then he calls me every Wednesday.",\par
